DESCRIPTION:The world is coming to Soldier Hollow September 19 and 20 for the Whoop UCI Mountain Bike World Series Presented by Scott Sports! The track is slated to provide lots of entertainment\, with plenty of multiline sections and natural rock features. Soldier Hollow is also uniquely spectator-friendly\, so you won’t want to miss the chance to watch the action from up close. Please visit the official event website for tickets and details not found here. Event Website
