SUMMARY:Soldier Hollow — USBA Fall Camp & Schutzenski Festival #1- October 9-11\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:Schutzenski Festival returns to Soldier Hollow Nordic Center this October. Once again\, we will have two whole weekends of fun! October 9-11 | USBA Fall Festival & International Team Trials The Schutzenski Biathlon Festival! This weekend features both elite and open classes\, from U13s to Masters. The weekend also features the annual SOHO Biathlon Shoot-Out at 12:30 on Saturday\, October 10. The second weekend of the Festival\, October 16-18\, is the Schutzenski Cross Country & Trail Running Race. Register Here
END:VEVENT
